Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,《星河战队2：联邦英雄》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.55,0:00:34.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在虫族突袭布宜诺斯艾利斯(阿根廷首都) 之后 联邦军英勇的反击
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.63,0:00:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联邦军在坦戈约里拉击溃了虫族 并且在P行星掳获虫族首脑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.89,0:00:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在此刻 英勇的机动部队更挟 胜利之姿 深入虫族隔离区去歼灭虫族
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:00:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我们所将遭遇的战争将比以往更激烈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our war is going better than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.34,0:01:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要英雄! 我们需要你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we need heroes! We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.47,0:01:09.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,入伍吧! 你们的事迹将永存!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you apes! You wanna live forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.43,0:01:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,服役就能获得公民权 想知道更多吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Service guarantees citizenship. Would you like to know more?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.06,0:01:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空军元帅部署了必胜的战略行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sky marshal launches Operation March to Victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.69,0:01:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整体战需要有胆识的新战略{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bold, new strategy calling for total war...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.74,0:01:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...在每个战线对抗虫族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...against the Bug, on every front.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.21,0:01:38.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想知道更多吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to know more?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.47,0:01:50.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心! 注意!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.23,0:01:55.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全体后退!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:58.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撤退! 撤退!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retreat! Retreat!
