Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:05.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 这是机动部队第6战队请求援救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, this is Mobile lnfantry Bravo 6 to Fleet Rescue,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是机动部队第6战队请求援救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Bravo 6 to Fleet Rescue,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全体后退!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撤退!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.43,0:02:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何顿 珊蒂 撤退!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horton, Sandee, pull back!
