Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.32,0:02:45.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没事吧! - 顶住!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're okay! - Hold what you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.99,0:02:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来吧 虫族! - 托尔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Bug! - Tor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.45,0:02:51.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掩护我们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cover our 6!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:53.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that 6,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:55.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 虫子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.79,0:03:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到没有? 收到没有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you copy? Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.63,0:03:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布列克掩护 托尔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brick! Cover Tor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.75,0:03:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 托尔 - 来呀 尝尝托尔的子弹 宝贝儿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tor, - Come and get some from Tor, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.31,0:03:17.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥特!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.39,0:03:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大兵 起来战斗或在这等死吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight or die, soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.73,0:03:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 二等兵萨哈拉! - 是 上士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Private Sahara! - Yes, sergeant?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:25.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二等兵奥特已经是个死人 如果他不还击虫族 就杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Private Otter is a dead man, If he won't fight, shoot him!
