Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扣扳机 比利! 虽然不够 但还是得做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just pull the trigger, Billie! It's not enough, but it'll have to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.49,0:03:35.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 救援舰呼叫第6战队 - 继续前进 救援舰在前面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fleet Rescue to Bravo 6. - Go ahead, Fleet Rescue,
