Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:46.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顶住这一波攻势! 守住战线!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold the perimeter! Hold that line!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.97,0:03:48.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 守住战线! - 不要给我找藉口!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold the line! - I don't want excuses!
