Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.97,0:03:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来帮我守住这个缺口 守住这个缺口!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in and plug that hole, Plug that hole!
