Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.23,0:03:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 顶住! - 虫子抓走了考!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold the line! - Bugs have got Coy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.81,0:04:03.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是夏福特将军 混蛋 我们需要接应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is General Shepherd, You jackass! We need pickup!
