Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.95,0:04:13.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军 看到了一些影像 但不清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General, getting a vision, It isn't clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:16.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们正在增多 我们被包围了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're building up, They're all around us,
