Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.62,0:04:23.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个厚重巨大的东西 可以让我们离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's something massive, lt'll take us all out,
