Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.01,0:04:37.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那上面没有掩护{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no cover on the Anvil,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.89,0:04:40.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们将强行突破 中尉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna have a rough ride, lieutenant!
