Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:24.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快 - 到那门那去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hurry up, - Grab that door,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.40,0:07:32.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比尔 救救我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill, help me, help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.65,0:07:39.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比利 快来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Billie, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.36,0:07:40.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住我的手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴低{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Stay down,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.87,0:07:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.46,0:07:49.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来! - 来 我抓住你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - It's okay, I got you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥特 柯比趴低!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otter, Kobe, get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:04.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续走 继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep going, Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不要停 继续 - 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep moving, Keep moving, - Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 走 - 柯比 小心!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go, - Kobe, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.53,0:08:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尔! 布列克!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tor! Brick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.41,0:08:25.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来! 走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With me! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:34.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尔 何顿! 让 柯比进去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tor, Horton! Get Kobe inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 布列克 跟我来 走! - 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Brick, with me, Go! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:40.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟着我 兄弟!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with me, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:43.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珊蒂! 前进!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandee! Move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:50.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里 你可以的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go, You're all right, you're all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:16.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布列克! 你和 珊蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brick! You and Sandee...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.25,0:09:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带1班 守住四周 萨哈拉? 把门关上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...take a squad, set a perimeter, Sahara? Get that door closed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.13,0:09:21.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.55,0:09:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快让开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make a hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.39,0:09:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让开一点! - 萨哈拉! 不要挡路!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Make it wide! - Sahara! Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.77,0:09:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 穿过来 - 不要挡路!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Coming through, - Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.60,0:09:34.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 不要紧张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, easy, Take it easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当心他的背{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch his back,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他的背包拿下来! 何顿 关掉无线电!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get his pack off! Horton, cut that radio off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.74,0:09:44.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮她拿下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that off him,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放轻松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.70,0:09:50.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 医药箱在哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all right, Where are those meds?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.07,0:10:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医药箱在哪? 可恶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are those meds? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:35.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 上士? - 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sergeant? - It's fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.75,0:10:38.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 上士! - 放轻松 放轻松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sergeant! - Just take it easy, Take it easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:41.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要一个人过去接上通讯 还有我需要救援接应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want someone on that com, and I want pickup,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.09,0:10:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 长官 是我们全部吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir, wouldn't we all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.09,0:10:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我命令你 上士 - 不要靠近门那 士官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's a direct order, sergeant, - No-go on the door, sarge,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躺下 休息一下 你需要休息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay down, Relax, buddy, You gotta relax,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.73,0:10:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能帮他做点什么吗 托尔?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't you do anything for this man, Tor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:10:59.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二等兵!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Private!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.94,0:11:02.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接上通讯! 我现在就要救援接应!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on that com, I want pickup now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.74,0:11:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在看什么看 二等兵? - 长官 没电力无法通讯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you looking at, private? - Sir, com don't run without power,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 在军官学校你应该有学到一个 上士应该可以解决所有问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, at OCS, you learn that a sergeant is the solution to any problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你去启动电力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you get the power up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:17.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会说救援舰怎么可能在这登陆?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say what kind of boat Fleet lands in a shit-storm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.37,0:11:20.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在下命令! 给我去执行!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am giving the orders! You will take them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.34,0:11:23.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要该死的电力! 现在就要!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the goddamn power! And I want it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.79,0:11:57.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在等着 上士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am waiting, sergeant,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何顿 奥特 萨哈拉 跟我走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horton, Otter, Sahara, with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 长官?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit, Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该要看看这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might want to see this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:32.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无线电没反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Radio's nonoperational,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.62,0:12:34.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中尉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming, lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看上去是何贝克上校匆忙留下的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like Colonel Hohlback left in a hurry,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.24,0:14:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:02.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我们有了同伴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say we've got company,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何顿! 你和奥特去启动反应堆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horton! You and Otter locate the reactors and fire them up,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.69,0:14:25.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是啥?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.77,0:14:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哨站反应炉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outpost incinerator,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远离那门!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move away from the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.37,0:14:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大兵为什么你还在这?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you still here, soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是因为没有人点火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably because no one lit the furnace,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.18,0:15:01.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,V J 达克斯上尉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain V,J, Dax,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.39,0:15:03.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来是个大英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Says here he's a big hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.64,0:15:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战斗勋章 青铜星章 紫心勋章 紫心勋章{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Combat medals, Bronze Stars, Purple Heart, Purple Heart, Purple Heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.56,0:15:10.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联邦勇气勋章{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Federal Medal of Valour at Widowmakers,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.94,0:15:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真他妈多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a lot of crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:15.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受伤过四次 拒绝很多次战地任务...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wounded four times, refused numerous battlefield commissions...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.99,0:15:17.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:12.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 英雄 - 你杀了何贝克上校?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Some hero, - You murdered Colonel Hohlback?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.92,0:16:16.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他用他的步枪和配枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had his Morita and a sidearm,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:20.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只用我的双手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just used my hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.93,0:16:22.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你使你的制服蒙羞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a disgrace to the uniform,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是一条疯狗 把他留在那{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a mad dog, He stays in the cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.18,0:16:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住 中尉 每条狗都有它的下场!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just remember, lieutenant, every dog has its day!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.19,0:16:32.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,士官! 发现敌人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarge! Hostiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.94,0:16:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这指挥 二等兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am in command here, private,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.99,0:16:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有多少? 我们的境况如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, how many and what's our situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.28,0:16:42.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看上去整个被包围了 - 我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Looks like a whole damn circus, - Let's go,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.83,0:16:50.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,士兵!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trooper!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.98,0:17:17.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找掩护! 右边防线 散开点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shelter! Right perimeter, spread wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.03,0:17:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们三个跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You three, follow me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.70,0:17:26.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他使我们太分散了! - 说点我不知道的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's spreading us too thin! - You know something I don't, trooper?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.01,0:17:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在逼近!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're shifting their lines!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.59,0:17:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 守着左边! 守住中间! 守住右边!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, take the left! Take the middle! Take the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.23,0:17:56.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珊蒂! 回报!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandee! Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.07,0:17:59.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有情况!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing! No movement!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.07,0:18:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来 狗杂种! 你们在等什么!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you bastards! What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.86,0:18:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴 笨蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, fathead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:07.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你和我一起 - 就像掩护你的6 嗯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You starting with me? - Just like covering your 6, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.80,0:18:22.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备开火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.93,0:18:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥特 起来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otter, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.27,0:18:37.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火! 开火! 开火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.70,0:18:50.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 虫子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.15,0:19:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗娘养的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:28.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后退!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.49,0:19:30.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前进! 我掩护你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, go, go! I got you covered!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.91,0:19:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比利 没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billie, It's okay, It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:38.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.30,0:19:40.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go go go go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:51.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all gonna die, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.98,0:19:58.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的手给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:20:01.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啥? - 把你的给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Give me your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.61,0:20:11.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.95,0:20:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 撑住! 撑住! - 别放手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold on! Hold on! - Don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.71,0:20:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.63,0:20:28.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把防线往后拉 中尉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull back your line, lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.53,0:20:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,武器!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.62,0:21:03.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.34,0:21:13.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫族!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.35,0:21:26.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴下! 走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.86,0:21:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好 听着! - 到底谁让你出来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, people, listen up! - Who the hell let you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.12,0:21:40.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 在15秒之内... - 狗娘养的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ln about 15 seconds... - All right, you son of a bitch...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛倒数到零!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shield your eyes at count zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.25,0:21:47.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pass the word!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:50.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在战斗中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off your ass, there's a war going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.76,0:21:53.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩 跟我到侧面!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two! With me on flank!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.64,0:21:59.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,10秒内引爆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perimeter burn in 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,10秒内引爆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perimeter burn in 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.35,0:22:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.07,0:22:12.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.41,0:22:22.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.50,0:22:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.83,0:22:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.17,0:22:28.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,零{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.63,0:22:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引爆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perimeter burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.85,0:23:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要两名自愿者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need two volunteers,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.39,0:23:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你以为你是谁阿 - 主角上场啰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who do you think you are? - The big stick that's running this show,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.32,0:23:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我来 - 我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll go, - Me too,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.23,0:23:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们5分钟内回不来 那表示路上有太多虫族了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're not back inside of five minutes, it means more Bugs are on the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.66,0:23:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说我们还没杀光他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean we didn't kill them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.24,0:23:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从来都不可能杀光他们 小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never kill them all, son,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.98,0:24:15.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, who's got...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.40,0:24:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A light,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.32,0:24:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥特 靠过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otter, take a knee,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.99,0:24:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你看到了那些线吗? - 是的 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You see those busted wires there? - Yes, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.41,0:24:30.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他们接起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the wiggle room, kid, Splice them together,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.42,0:24:32.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,士兵 把那递给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trooper, hand me that...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.34,0:24:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的刀在哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.55,0:24:40.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把它弄丢了 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must have lost it, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.97,0:24:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我队里谁要弄丢了刀子就得挨鞭子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone who loses his knife in my unit would be strung up for lashes, kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.03,0:25:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心那根红线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to be careful with the red wire,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.24,0:25:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有动静了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got movement!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.20,0:25:09.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何顿 照明四周{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horton, illumination round,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.34,0:25:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别开火 我们正要过来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire, we're coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.80,0:25:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是将军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the general,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.43,0:25:22.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到他了! 他带了2个人回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see him! He's bringing home two,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.47,0:25:25.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他带了3个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's bringing home three,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.10,0:25:28.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜猜谁到不了 希望不是葛蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonder who didn't make it, Hope it wasn't Goldy,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.14,0:25:33.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚报到第一天时他对我很好 就是那些小事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was nice to me on my first day, It's those little things that count,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.19,0:25:35.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做你那该死的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, like doing your goddamn job,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.57,0:25:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敌人跟在你们将军的屁股后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hostiles! Right on your general's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.44,0:25:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 小子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.08,0:26:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outstanding,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.95,0:26:33.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 该死! 真臭 - 待会你闻起来也会那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That stinks! - You get so you like it after a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.50,0:26:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不会忘记这 - 我也是 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Son, I'll never forget it, - Me neither, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.59,0:26:41.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为我是怎样的家伙? 手放下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of a-hole do you think I am? Put her there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.59,0:26:43.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.42,0:26:46.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你是谁 但是你是跟我一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know who you are, but you're aces with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.72,0:26:51.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么将军 我只是做我该做的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing personal, general, I'm just doing my job,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.56,0:26:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 让我帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, fellas, let me give you a hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.36,0:27:01.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 还真重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, I got a dog back home weighs more than she does,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.95,0:27:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看是谁回来了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, look what the cat drug in!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.00,0:27:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该看到那该死的猫! 我们在这该死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should see that damn cat! We're in the shitter, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.92,0:27:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们有机会的 - 很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We got a chance, - Good to see you,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.26,0:27:24.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有坏消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want the bad news or the bad news?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.22,0:27:27.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我差点忘了你的刀 - 留着吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I almost forgot your knife, - Keep it, kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.97,0:27:30.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 我不能 - 士兵需要刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I couldn't, - Trooper needs a knife,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.39,0:27:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,军官只告诉士兵们死于何所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officers just tell troopers where to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.02,0:27:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不是吧 长官? - 提防你的军官 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's not really true, is it, sir? - Watch out for officers, son,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.52,0:27:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会害死你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's their job to get you killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.45,0:27:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一波进来 的可和史雷特被杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First wave came in, and Deke and Slater were killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.70,0:27:57.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后 一波波的进来... 那小子也挂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Came in again and that...That kid Goldy was gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.42,0:28:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后这将是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then it was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.84,0:28:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和欧哈拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...me and O'Hara,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.80,0:28:07.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些狗娘养的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That magnificent son of a bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.89,0:28:11.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们挡住他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We held them,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.10,0:28:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.48,0:28:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你处境狼狈时,勋章可是一文不值{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...star don't mean a hill of beans when you're caught between shit and sweat,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.61,0:28:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后那两个浑小子出现了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then these two beautiful bastards show up,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.19,0:28:29.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那两个 和他们带着的手榴弹...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These two here, and they're carrying a couple of grenades...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.86,0:28:32.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,满身的精力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and they got a boatload of gumption,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.74,0:28:34.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救了我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they saved my sorry ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.16,0:28:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿意向你介绍他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'd like to introduce you to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.58,0:28:40.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医疗士官乔 格列佛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Corporal Joe Griff, Medical Corps,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.75,0:28:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技术士官 阿里 皮克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is Technical Sergeant Ari Peck,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.59,0:28:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没法告诉你关于这个睡美人的事...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I can't tell you a thing about Sleeping Beauty over here...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.34,0:28:51.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为她从头睡到尾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because she snored through the whole damn thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.72,0:28:53.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是二等兵 苏达 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Private Soda, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.76,0:28:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自我们被截断后就没闭过眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She didn't sleep after our unit got chopped down,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.60,0:29:00.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥 五天以前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found Peck the next day, what, about five days ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.73,0:29:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都须要睡眠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody's gotta sleep sometime,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.82,0:29:07.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么故事 皮克?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your story, Peck?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.61,0:29:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,32技术旅唯一生还者 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}32nd Tech Brigade, sole survivor, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.24,0:29:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's me,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.70,0:29:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在外面呆了将近一个月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been out there about a month, near as I can tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.21,0:29:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是段长时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.92,0:29:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有点长 我想是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty long, yeah, I guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.25,0:29:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好 我们送你回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then, we got to get you home,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.51,0:29:31.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪尔中尉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Dill,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.43,0:29:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是 长官! - 接应安排好了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir! - Has pickup been arranged?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.07,0:29:49.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 皮克上士 我能和你谈谈吗? - 是 长官?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sergeant Peck, can I talk to you? - Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.78,0:29:53.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以恢复通讯吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you can make this com talk and squawk like it ought to?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.03,0:30:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会尽量去修 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you can bet I'll die trying, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.50,0:30:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 先睡会儿等一下再试吧 - 喔 不 不 我现在就能搞定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get some sleep and try later, - Oh, no, no, I'll get on this right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.34,0:30:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 上士!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's outstanding, sergeant!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.21,0:30:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是你们机动部队的典范 谢啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a credit to your Mobile lnfantry unit, Thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.38,0:30:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你上次洗澡是什么时候?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When is the last time you took a shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.84,0:30:18.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我们离开这在考虑味道好不好闻吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's worry about the sniff factor after we get our asses unslung,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.93,0:30:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.36,0:30:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能关上这门 我们会安全点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could sit pretty tight if we could shut this door, sergeant,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.16,0:30:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会派个人做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get someone on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.99,0:30:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少还有个家伙守在该守的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least there's one man looking in the right direction,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.16,0:30:44.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.93,0:30:55.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她怎么了 下士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with her, corporal?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.97,0:30:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,风太干了 让她鼻黏膜出血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the wind, sir, Dries out the membranes,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.22,0:31:04.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 醒来就没事了 - 看来她会受到很好的照顾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She'll be fine when she wakes up, - She's got the right idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.19,0:31:06.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安士兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, troopers,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.02,0:31:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们全都睡一下吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get some sleep, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.15,0:31:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's an order,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.11,0:31:13.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还有 迪尔 - 是 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And, Dill... - Yes, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.90,0:31:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我醒来时要一份今天所有行动的简报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want a full report of today's action when I wake up...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.07,0:31:19.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解释你如何使我的五个士兵送了命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...explaining how you got five of my troopers killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.12,0:31:21.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.62,0:31:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们听到长官说的了 去睡觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard the man, Hit the sack!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.30,0:31:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你除外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you, trooper,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.80,0:31:38.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 长官?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.30,0:31:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,释放那个罪犯是违反军法的犯罪行为 二等兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letting that criminal loose is a court-martial offence, private,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.18,0:31:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为他可以帮助我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought he could help us,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.85,0:31:48.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为谋杀犯的决定比你的指挥官还好?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought the judgment of a murderer was preferable to an officer's?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.31,0:31:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 你可以在审判时把那当作你的辩词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that'll make for a hell of a compelling defence,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.28,0:31:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思 只是直觉如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't thinking, sir, It was intuition,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.07,0:31:58.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直觉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Intuition?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.87,0:32:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你是个超灵者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had no idea you were psychic,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.92,0:32:10.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小时候这方面成绩很高 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I scored high when I was a kid, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.63,0:32:11.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.21,0:32:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你为什么不加入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why aren't you wearing the black?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.67,0:32:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我变的很不稳定 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I became inconsistent, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.84,0:32:21.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,青春期?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Onset of puberty?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.22,0:32:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生在你们女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It happens to you women,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.48,0:32:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么时候发生在你身上? - 对不起?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When is it gonna happen to you? - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.73,0:32:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,青春期 我听说在变成男人前那是必然的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Puberty, I hear it's a necessary step on the way to becoming a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.78,0:32:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在污辱联邦军官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're addressing an officer of the Federation,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.74,0:32:40.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别提军官那套狗屎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shove that officer crap up your Buster Brown,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.74,0:32:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个像你今天如此作为的军官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An officer who behaves as you did today...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.16,0:32:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且在一个士兵身上发泄怨气 根本不算是一个男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and takes it out on a trooper ain't a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.33,0:32:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是个男人? 怎么样的男人会背叛联邦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a man? What kind of a man turns his back on the Federation?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.17,0:32:51.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴你开口问了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you asked,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.79,0:32:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我训练了一代代的人把自己带向死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trained a generation of people to throw themselves into the grinder,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.80,0:32:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联邦利用完就舍弃他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Federation chewed them up and spit them out,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.63,0:33:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以现在当人们说 "为了荣耀而战" 我却认为"哪来的荣耀?"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now when they say, "Push on to glory," I say, "What glory?"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.76,0:33:06.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道什么叫荣耀? 你竟敢说自己是个英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you know about glory? You call yourself a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.06,0:33:12.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 小子 那是别人叫的 不过是个骗局罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, son, That's something other people call you, and it's really just a trick,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.73,0:33:17.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你牺牲了自己的生命 除了白痴外他们也会叫你英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you throw your life away, instead of fool, they call you hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.36,0:33:22.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于荣誉 你可以问她 她会告诉你一切!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as for glory, ask her, She'll tell you everything you need to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.87,0:33:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你敢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.29,0:33:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是一个人的看法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one man's opinion,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.08,0:33:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 这是叛逆!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not, It's treason!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.46,0:33:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你或许应该开枪射我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then maybe you ought to shoot me,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.96,0:33:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一些事我们达成一致{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, there's something we agree on,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.09,0:33:41.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来呀 拿出你的枪来呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, go ahead, Take out that popgun and have at it, soldier,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.72,0:33:48.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信联盟里的规章制度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe in the rules and regulations that the Federation stands for,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.18,0:33:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常好 中尉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good, lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.31,0:33:52.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你漏掉了这些孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you left out the kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.44,0:33:54.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 懦夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Cowards,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.57,0:33:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们总是躲藏在规章和孩子后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They always hide behind rules and children,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.21,0:34:12.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会看着你被处死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you hang!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.50,0:34:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你等着吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just so long as it's regulation rope,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.55,0:34:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, let's see,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.93,0:34:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉干 鸡蛋 硬面包 豆子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got your mystery meat sticks, egg caps, hardtack, beans,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.60,0:34:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即时素食 巧克力布丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Insta-veggie meal, Choco-pudding Delite,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.09,0:35:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢吃甜食?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet tooth, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.68,0:35:07.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,15分钟内熄灯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taps in 15 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.48,0:35:17.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会抓到你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.72,0:35:51.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴你终于醒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to have you with us, trooper,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.39,0:35:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你睡了很久 觉得如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been out for a long time, How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.15,0:36:03.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel good, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.23,0:36:04.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还行吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fit for duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.40,0:36:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raring to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.37,0:36:13.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's outstanding,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.32,0:36:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要多久我们才可以关上这扇门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the ETA on a door we can shut, gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.24,0:36:57.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想可以了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, sir, I think that should do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.41,0:36:59.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你坚持的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'll hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.26,0:37:13.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小心那条电缆! - 电缆 住手 住手!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch out for the cables! - The cables, Stop it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.97,0:37:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续 继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it, do it, do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.77,0:37:20.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗屎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.99,0:37:29.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完了 你把这该死的东西焊死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great, you welded the damn thing open,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.28,0:37:30.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这白痴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You idiots,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.53,0:37:34.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都去防守{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel to the perimeter,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.99,0:37:38.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,士兵 你听到了 我们走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Troopers, you heard the man, Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.00,0:37:41.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行动! 拿上武器 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get moving! Take that weapon, Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.88,0:37:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珊蒂 何顿 苏达 布列克 快 你们这些懒虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandee, Horton, Soda, Brick, come on, you lazy bastards,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.42,0:37:48.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走 快 走 走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move it, Move, move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.63,0:37:52.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨哈拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sahara,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.14,0:37:57.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩去那 你们俩去跑去前面 我的OP呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two over there, you two front and running, Where's my OP?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.06,0:38:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,守住岗位 走 走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man your post! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.86,0:38:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了? - 将军 有些事情...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's wrong? - General, there's something...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.91,0:38:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.24,0:38:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,侦察到敌人 100米以外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scouting parties, sir, 100 metres out,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.50,0:38:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们想干麻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they figure that fence is down...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.71,0:38:25.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们真像在富翁的葬礼上出现的亲人一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they're gonna show up like relatives to a rich man's funeral,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.67,0:38:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让那亮起来 - 是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let there be light, - Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.30,0:38:37.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是 - 我们有 我们有电了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - Here we go, We got power,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.10,0:38:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能看到你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I'm talking about, I can see you now,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.23,0:38:43.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, general?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.06,0:38:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 皮克 是你做的吗? - 有点不稳...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Peck, is this your doing? - It's a little wonky...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.57,0:38:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...但它能支持住 我希望是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but it'll hold, I hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.61,0:38:53.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我代表大家感谢你皮克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have our tremendous gratitude, Peck,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.95,0:38:57.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 没什么 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it was nothing, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.20,0:39:01.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回去做修通讯器了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get back to work on the com now,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.66,0:39:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 硬是要得 皮克 - 做得好 皮克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Attaboy, Peck, - Way to go, Peck,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.00,0:39:08.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮克 皮克 皮克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peck, Peck, Peck,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.00,0:39:11.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.01,0:39:16.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达克斯对你的指控是很严重的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dax, the charges against you are serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.64,0:39:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我不能承担失去像你这样有经验的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I can't afford to lose a man of your experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.85,0:39:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答应我 做你身为一个军官该做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your word as an officer you'll do your duty,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.35,0:39:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不再是个军官了 将军 但是我以男人的尊严答应你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm no longer an officer, general, but I'll give you my word as a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.73,0:39:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的军衔恢复 直到你的罪行或清白...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your rank is restored until your guilt or innocence...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.28,0:39:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被听证会裁决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is determined by a hearing,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.40,0:39:36.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以向你坦承是我杀了何贝克上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I can assure you I killed Colonel Hohlback,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.70,0:39:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我担保你会绞刑 不过到那之前 我期望你尽你的职责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I guarantee you'll hang, but until then, I expect you to do your duty,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.41,0:39:44.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是 长官 - 我要前去OP{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir, - I want forward OP,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.29,0:39:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一天3个人看守{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three watches a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.67,0:39:50.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然士兵们会变得懒散{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fences fail, troopers get lazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.17,0:39:53.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 继续努力 上尉 - 是 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You carry on, captain, - Yes, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.80,0:40:34.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以为你做什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something I can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.51,0:40:38.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想说谢谢你救了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just came to say thanks for saving my ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.89,0:40:41.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the job,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.18,0:40:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不睡觉在这看守吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come you don't sleep inside like everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.73,0:40:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想这是敌人会出现的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figure this is where the enemy will show up,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.06,0:40:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里有啥乐子吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No telling what kind of fun you could get in out here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.28,0:41:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在挑逗我吗? - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you flirting with me, soldier? - No, sir, I don't flirt,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.87,0:41:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有? - 从来没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Never? - Never ever, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.91,0:41:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯 一言为定 - 货真价实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, you're the real deal, - The genuine article,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.09,0:41:14.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你想行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you want some action,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.80,0:41:19.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫子出现后你想怎么做就去做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll get all the action you want after the Bugs show up,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.68,0:41:26.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.35,0:41:31.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...这是我所等待的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it's all the waiting that gets me,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.94,0:41:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 我懂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I see,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.90,0:41:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要有人占有你的心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need something to occupy your mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.17,0:41:54.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到这来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.22,0:42:02.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这 做伏地挺身100下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good right there, Drop and give me 100,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.80,0:42:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 长官? - 你精力旺盛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir? - You got a lot of energy, trooper,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.72,0:42:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴下 开始计数{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now get down and start counting,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.48,0:42:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.15,0:42:19.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一 二 三 四{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, three, four...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.95,0:42:24.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五 六 七{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...five, six, seven...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.99,0:42:26.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,200下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it 200,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.11,0:42:58.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少了什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lose something?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.11,0:43:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 你是新手 所以我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, you're the new guy, so I...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.99,0:43:07.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以一起玩吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we play too?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.24,0:43:11.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去做自己的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got mess duty,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.54,0:43:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢把我叫醒 苏达 - 乐意之至{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks for the wake up, Soda, - Pleasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.54,0:43:17.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你在做什么事吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure you know what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.67,0:43:21.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个好主意 但是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I got a pretty good idea, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.59,0:43:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道 熟能生巧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you know, practice does make perfect,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.26,0:43:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.14,0:43:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 比利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Billie,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.51,0:44:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不 别管他 珊蒂 他是个浑球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, forget it, Sandee, He's a jerk,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.47,0:44:13.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 珊蒂...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Sandee...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.56,0:44:19.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她怎么了? - 何顿跟另外新来的女人搞在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's with her? - Horton's with the new girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.11,0:44:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他想喝点苏达汽水吧 - 战争?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sipping some Soda, - Ain't war hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.08,0:44:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁在那?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.92,0:44:42.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何顿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horton?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.88,0:44:47.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's you,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.97,0:44:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.27,0:44:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.23,0:44:58.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.85,0:45:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我能做些什么? - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anything I can do? - No,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.15,0:45:05.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少让我看看你的下巴怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least let me take a look at that cut on your chin,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.19,0:45:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这? 只是刮伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This? It's just a scratch,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.32,0:45:11.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军希望每个人都没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General wants everybody tiptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.25,0:45:19.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘿 乔? - 是?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Joe? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.58,0:45:22.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里有多久了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long have you been out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.92,0:45:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 感觉好像我一生都在这里 - 是 我明白你的意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All my life, it seems like, - Yeah, I know what you mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.30,0:45:31.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这里有八个月了 只看到过两次阳光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been here for eight months, and I've only seen the sun twice,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.72,0:45:34.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你把头盔卸掉也许好些 吉尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might be a little easier if you took your helmet off, Jill,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.31,0:45:44.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天 你的手指怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, what happened to your fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.52,0:45:48.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道 烧伤的 - 看上去很可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know, muzzle burn, - That looks really bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.53,0:45:52.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁是医护人员?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, who's the medic here anyway, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.78,0:45:57.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Joe,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.20,0:45:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.79,0:46:01.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有人说你笑起来很好看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has anybody ever told you what a nice smile you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.46,0:46:05.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.30,0:46:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.55,0:46:12.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉好点了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feeling better?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.51,0:46:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.81,0:46:19.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.34,0:46:53.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她怎么了 士官? - 只是流鼻血 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened to her, corporal? - Just a nosebleed, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.59,0:46:55.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gonna be fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.76,0:46:59.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你感觉如何? - 你清楚的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you feel? - You know how I feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.73,0:47:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.94,0:47:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看上去一对又一对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like we got a couple new couples,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.82,0:47:11.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难怪这场战争我们会输 没人在打仗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wonder we're losing this war, Everyone's fucking instead of fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.49,0:47:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在看什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.12,0:47:19.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 回去工作 - 我会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get back to work, - I'll get to work,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.17,0:47:28.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 早安 上尉 - 有什么好的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning, captain, - What makes you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.13,0:47:31.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么? 它们来了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, are we in for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.46,0:47:36.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 迟早 - 你有时间吃早餐?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sooner or later, - You got time for breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.51,0:47:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你不期望有愉快的交谈 欢迎一起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome to join me, as long as you don't expect cheerful conversation,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.93,0:47:44.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是个习惯早起的人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a morning person, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.39,0:47:47.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我是个一团糟的杀人浑蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm a miserable, murdering bastard,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.69,0:47:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 然而那是好的一天 - 那坏日子是怎么样的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And that's on a good day, - What's a bad day like?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.53,0:47:53.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对那天特别感兴趣?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any one day in particular you're interested in?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.78,0:47:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.83,0:48:02.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个超灵者浑球派你来问我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That second lieu-y send you to question me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.37,0:48:05.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 迪尔中尉? 他认为我是个白痴 - 是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lieutenant Dill? He thinks I'm an idiot, - Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.92,0:48:10.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我? 嗯 绝对是 - 相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Me? Yeah, Definitely, - Trust me, I got you beat,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.71,0:48:15.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我坠入爱河 然后我被降级{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I fell in love, and I got busted down from corporal for fraternisation,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.05,0:48:20.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那家伙是谁? - 这就是我白痴的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So who wants to be a corporal? - Here's the idiot part,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.39,0:48:22.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他阵亡了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He got killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.14,0:48:28.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的有超感应力?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really some kind of psychic?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.31,0:48:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜是吧 不过不像迪尔 是个超灵者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Maybe, I guess, Not like Dill, not Psi Corps,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.53,0:48:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, your fella...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.70,0:48:40.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...你预先知道他会阵亡吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...did you know he was gonna buy the farm?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.03,0:48:43.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是像那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't work that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.70,0:48:45.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 很好 我想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's good, I guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.54,0:48:48.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许这正是为什么我不信那种空话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe that's why I don't believe in all that bunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.29,0:48:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些标牌是你那些死去士兵的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those tags belong to the troopers that you lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.46,0:48:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...而你戴上它 因为你觉得要对发生的事负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you wear them because you feel responsible for what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.43,0:49:00.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是你幸运猜中的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a lucky guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.26,0:49:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你为什么要杀了你的上级 - 你告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why'd you kill your CO? - You tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.60,0:49:06.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没那厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not that good,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.77,0:49:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只会下些愚蠢的命令让那些孩子被杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave some stupid orders that got kids killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.56,0:49:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一次又一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day too many, or too many one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.82,0:49:17.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 或许这是我的错 - 你该原谅你自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe I'm the wheel that broke, - You ought to forgive yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.49,0:49:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's war,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.95,0:49:23.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要浪费太多时间在我这 士兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't spend too much time around me, trooper,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.66,0:49:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受够你跟着我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd hate to end up wearing your tags,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.20,0:50:04.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid Bug,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.95,0:50:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来看着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're relieved,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.87,0:50:10.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.98,0:50:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 士兵?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey... Hey, trooper?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.19,0:50:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁在那?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.32,0:50:40.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peck,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.41,0:50:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,士官 你有什么要我做的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, sarge, what do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.99,0:50:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要一个帮手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I could use a hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.70,0:50:54.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会为你做的很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buddy, anything I can do for you is aces by me,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.25,0:51:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以躺在地上吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you could lie down on the fl...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.72,0:51:05.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 地上? - 地上 然后到那后面...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The floor? - Floor, And reach behind the cons...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.76,0:51:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 你让我躺在地上然后操作那控制台{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it, I got it, You want me to lay on the floor and reach behind the console,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.73,0:51:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.77,0:51:16.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.36,0:51:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.32,0:51:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样行吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.79,0:51:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.37,0:51:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.25,0:51:38.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotta keep quiet,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.14,0:51:51.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命! 救命!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.35,0:52:34.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以通讯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got com,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.98,0:52:38.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以通讯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got com.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.73,0:52:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是"三角洲旅馆"哨站呼叫救援舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is "三角洲旅馆"哨站 to Fleet Rescue,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.53,0:52:46.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in, Fleet Rescue,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.37,0:52:52.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是"三角洲旅馆"哨站呼叫救援舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is "三角洲旅馆"哨站 to Fleet Rescue,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.41,0:52:56.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是 - 那些报告怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is... - How's that report coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.87,0:53:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与其写报告不如开始架你的绞首台 达克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm not so much writing a report as building your gallows, Dax,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.34,0:53:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不知道你是个木匠 - 改变频率{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't take you for a carpenter, - Shift to Command frequency,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.34,0:53:09.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上千年以前有个木匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was this other carpenter a few thousand years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.68,0:53:12.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...比你和我好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a better man than you or me,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.31,0:53:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作的时候死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that carpentry business was the death of him,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.93,0:53:18.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意你所做的有没有超过你能承受的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful of what you build and what crosses you bear,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.10,0:53:23.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- "三角洲旅馆"哨站呼叫救援舰 - 中尉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "三角洲旅馆"哨站 to Fleet Command, - Lieutenant,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.48,0:53:28.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到"三角洲旅馆" 这里是舰队指挥中心 完毕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger, Hotel Delta, this is Fleet Command. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.70,0:53:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,701机动部队 请求救援接应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the 701 st Mobile lnfantry, Bravo Company, requesting pickup,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.74,0:53:37.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得排队 这里到处都有部队需要救援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a number, MI. We got stragglers all over the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.37,0:53:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字? - 舰队中尉玛丽 克雷高夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your name, sailor? - Fleet Lieutenant Mary Klinghof.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.09,0:53:45.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我也帮不了你们 - 给我听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Getting smart won't help you, jarhead. - You listen up, fruit fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.96,0:53:48.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是杰克 高登 夏福特将军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is General Jack Gordon Shepherd,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.43,0:53:51.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不优先救援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if somebody doesn't make this pickup their priority...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.76,0:53:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我会把你们列在我的优先名单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm gonna make it my priority to come down...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.56,0:53:57.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从你开始整死你们这些浑蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and chew out some Fleet-ass, starting with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.56,0:54:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 长官 我不知道在跟谁说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, sir, I didn't know who I was talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.81,0:54:03.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是因为你是个白痴 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's because you're a moron, - Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.31,0:54:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 长官 但是我们有很多伤患{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir, but we got a lot of wounded out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.28,0:54:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤患先走 别再找藉口了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wounded come first, Any excuses after that come out of your butt,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.32,0:54:12.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shepherd, out,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.12,0:54:16.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮克在哪? 我要给他个荣誉勋章{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Peck? I'm gonna give him a medal,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.45,0:54:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 睡着了 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Asleep, sir, Dead on his feet, - Well, he's earned it,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.66,0:54:24.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 门修好了没 - 我们都在等着 士官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any day on that door, Brick, - We're all waiting for something, sarge,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.46,0:54:27.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但是这不是门 - 漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But it ain't the door, - Outstanding,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.63,0:55:07.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你 士兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you, trooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.88,0:55:10.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 猜的好 - 我们都将战死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lucky guess. - We're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.47,0:55:14.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道荣誉是什么? - 这没用的啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What would you know about glory? - It doesn't work that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.76,0:55:19.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 如果他不战斗 杀了他! - 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If he won't fight, shoot him! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.85,0:55:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 萨哈拉 - 我看不到他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sahara. - I haven't seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.06,0:55:26.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 醒醒 - 是我的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wake up. - The wheel that broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.94,0:55:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.03,0:55:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.85,0:56:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多来点别害羞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a little more, Don't be shy, Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.36,0:56:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别急 吃得到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Oh, trouble at the trough,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.69,0:56:13.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不好看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna get ugly,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.62,0:56:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啥吃了托尔 - 不是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's eating Tor, huh? - Not you,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.95,0:56:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你是对的 战争使人古怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I guess you're right, War does some weird things to people,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.19,0:56:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切还好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.61,0:57:00.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我我我 没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm... Yeah, I'm fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.05,0:57:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你看上去在发抖 士兵 - 是的 有些事情有点不对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You look a little shaky, trooper, - Yeah, something's not right,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.27,0:57:27.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是因为你被敌人包围{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what they call it when you're behind enemy lines,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.52,0:57:29.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我感觉比那更糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It feels worse than that,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.60,0:57:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 是不是别的超感应力出现了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, is this another one of your psychic hot flashes?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.73,0:57:34.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像托尔有些不对劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems like Tor has changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.86,0:57:37.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他没吃饭?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he wouldn't take Brick's bait? About time,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.82,0:57:41.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很突然 士官 - 像你今早呕吐吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- lt seems sudden, sarge, - Like you puking your guts out?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.62,0:57:44.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我会弄清原因的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I'm coming down with something,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.41,0:57:47.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好奇那是为啥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder what that could be?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.41,0:57:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的胃好像打结了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a big knot where my stomach used to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.25,0:57:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,士官 我刚才碰了医护兵的手 看到了一些事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarge, I barely touched the medic's hand just now, and I saw something,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.29,0:57:56.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你看到什么? - 一些可怕的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You saw something? - Something terrible,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.80,0:58:00.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 也许你是疯了 - 我也爱你 士官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe you're just going crazy, - I love you too, sarge,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.30,0:58:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当女人怀孕时就会古怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girls get wacky when they're pregnant,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.56,0:58:07.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然间他们就会知道所有的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suddenly, they know everything about everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.56,0:58:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Jesus,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.69,0:58:16.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 你开始成为超灵者了啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you're about as psychic as a doorknob, trooper,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.14,0:58:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你准备好了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.19,0:58:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有些累{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm kind of tired,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.69,0:59:03.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我会帮助你的 - 好 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll give you a hand, - Oh, thanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.70,0:59:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的鞋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my shoe,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.33,0:59:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管它了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.25,0:59:17.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你怕洗澡 奥特? - 有啥关系?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you scared to shower, Otter? - What does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.42,0:59:20.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再过几小时我们可以回家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going home in a few hours anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.57,0:59:38.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.49,0:59:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝 这是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy God, what the...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.52,1:00:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God, Oh, God,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.41,1:00:30.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开门! 开门! 我们会死在这里的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the door! Open the door! We're gonna die in here!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.29,1:00:32.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开门!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.40,1:01:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上尉 我想和你谈谈 但是这好像有点不可思议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, I need to talk to you, but it's gonna sound crazy,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.16,1:01:09.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好 说吧 - 看 长官...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, spit it out, trooper, - Look, sir...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.62,1:01:12.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...我知道我不被认为是个超灵者...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l know I'm not really supposed to be psychic...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.58,1:01:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我有一种不好的预感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I have this terrible feeling,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.46,1:01:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 长官 - 稍息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir, - As you were,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.59,1:01:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们遇到一些情况 需要超灵军官关注{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a situation here that requires the attention of Military lntelligence,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.43,1:01:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 告诉他 - 今早...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell him, - This morning, in the mess...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.18,1:01:35.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...我无意中碰到了格列佛的手 我看到了影像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l accidentally touched Griff's hand, I might've had a vision,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.43,1:01:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又再扮超灵者 二等兵?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Playing psychic again, private?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.73,1:01:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以先不预设立场吗 中尉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you keep an open mind here, lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.44,1:01:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她有重要的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This trooper's got information that's vital,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.07,1:01:47.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有几个士兵近来表现得很奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of the troopers have been acting a little strange lately,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.66,1:01:54.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,描述一下你所看到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Describe what you saw,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.04,1:01:57.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是人 他是一些其他的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't a man, He was some other thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.66,1:02:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许1000个 他传给...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe 1000 things, Somehow he was connected...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.50,1:02:05.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尔和珊蒂和何顿 还有新来的女孩 苏达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to Tor and Sandee and Horton and that new girl, Soda,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.67,1:02:10.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直弄不清楚 然而这感觉很尖锐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always been pretty fuzzy, sir, and this came through sharp as a knife,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.10,1:02:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中尉 我知道我不像你一样是超灵者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant, I know I'm not a real psychic like you,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.22,1:02:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 我怀孕了 我毫无头绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, I just found out I'm pregnant, and I didn't have a clue,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.56,1:02:24.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你怀孕了? - 是 长官 恐怕是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're pregnant? - Yes, sir, I'm afraid so,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.15,1:02:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该知道我们研究过...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might be interested to know that in our studies...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.24,1:02:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...怀孕可以提高超感应力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...pregnancy has been shown to heighten psychic ability,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.12,1:02:35.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就糟了 我希望我是错的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's too bad because I'd really like to be wrong,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.49,1:02:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我也是 但我也有相同的感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, me too, but I keep having the same feeling,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.37,1:02:43.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.92,1:02:45.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会被它们消灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming to wipe us out,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.51,1:02:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么说?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's so new about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.38,1:02:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说整个人类种族 它们有个计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean the whole species, everything human, And they have a plan,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.56,1:02:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那场战争之后...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, after what I did in the battle...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.35,1:03:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...我不能确定自我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l wasn't very sure of myself anymore,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.19,1:03:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想每个人都认为我砸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I just figured everybody thought I'd just cracked,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.49,1:03:14.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天 我就应该同意中尉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yesterday, I might have been inclined to agree...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.87,1:03:18.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是我搞砸了中尉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but that would've been me screwing up, lieutenant,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.87,1:03:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.50,1:03:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得立即向将军报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get on this matter with General Shepherd immediately,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.97,1:03:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 士兵...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and, trooper...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.26,1:03:37.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做的很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that was some good work,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.56,1:03:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.05,1:04:12.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏福特将军?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Shepherd?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.30,1:04:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.56,1:04:24.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰克将军和我在聊天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Jack and l were just having a chat,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.81,1:04:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪尔 你在这里做什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here, Dill?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.23,1:04:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和夏福特?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and Shepherd?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.99,1:04:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很难相信吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that so hard to believe?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.28,1:04:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.41,1:04:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏福特将军?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Shepherd?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.67,1:04:49.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.77,1:05:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在你身体里 天呐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're inside of you, Oh, God,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.52,1:05:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后 否则我轰爆开你的头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back up, or I'll drill your damn skull,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.74,1:05:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回来! 从那门走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back! Get away from the door,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.45,1:05:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.58,1:05:25.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的 你们都被捕了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bastards, You're all under arrest...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.46,1:05:30.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...因为谋杀 暴乱 反叛联邦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for murder, sedition, for treason against the Federation...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.75,1:05:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会杀你们不过你们会付出代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and you're gonna pay because we're not gonna kill you,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.30,1:05:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不 你看 我们位置有利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, No, you see, we got special places for things like you...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.64,1:05:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们抓到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where they cut you up,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.43,1:05:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他们让你活着...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they keep you alive while they cut you up...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.18,1:05:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...他们就能知道什么能逼你 什么能使你生病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so they can see what makes you tick, and they'll see what makes you sick,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.40,1:05:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会在那 是 我会去那看...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll be there, Oh, yeah, I'm gonna be there to see...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.16,1:06:09.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被逮捕了 达克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're under arrest, Dax,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.04,1:06:12.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罪名?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On what charge?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.38,1:06:14.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谋杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murder,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.24,1:06:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 达克斯上尉 发生什么事了? - 不准和囚犯讲话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Captain Dax, what's happening? - No talking to the prisoner,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.54,1:06:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他关起来 跟我保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep him covered, You gave me your word, Dax,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.50,1:07:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么让你认为我做了这 将军?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you think I had anything to do with this, general?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.89,1:07:11.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 把他锁上 上士 - 是 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lock him up, sergeant, - Yes, sir, With pleasure, sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.36,1:07:23.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快从这逃出去 萨哈拉 - 走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get out of here now, Sahara, - Move it,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.67,1:07:34.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道该做什么 比利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what to do, Billie,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.00,1:07:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.60,1:07:51.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么 比利?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you doing this, Billie?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.52,1:07:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是你和我 是我们所有人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not you and me, It's gonna happen to all of us,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.37,1:08:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要跟那扇门生孩子吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You trying to make a baby with my barracks door, private?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.67,1:08:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨哈拉 她不想要 但我要给她个虫子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sahara, she don't want it, but I gotta give her the Bug,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.92,1:08:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你秀逗了吗 - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's a wire loose in your head, - No, it's a little piece of God,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.43,1:08:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再是过去深信联邦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not like the one people used to believe in, or the Federation...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.22,1:08:33.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,充满了我 我可以感觉到自己飘了起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and it's filling me up, I can sort of feel myself floating away,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.02,1:08:36.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid, you're not making any sense,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.48,1:08:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你醒了你就会明白的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll understand when you wake up,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.57,1:08:44.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我醒来的时候?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I wake up?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.37,1:08:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不要抵抗了 - 门都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't fight, - That'll be the day,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.80,1:09:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.55,1:09:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你孤单吗? 上尉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lonely, captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.65,1:10:44.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比利 不要 求求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billie, please don't, Please,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.92,1:14:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎么了 士官?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's going on, sergeant?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.88,1:14:43.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 虫子在里面 长官 - 在这里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Bugs are inside, sir, - lnside the perimeter?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.35,1:14:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.56,1:14:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我体内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside me,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.60,1:14:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,士官 不! 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.08,1:15:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keys,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.67,1:15:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那虫子究竟是什么? - 天呐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell kind of Bug is that? - Jesus,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.63,1:15:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们侵入体内 然后接管一切 也许这能解释这一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One that gets inside and takes over, Maybe it can tell us something,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.09,1:15:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.69,1:15:42.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这发生的一是早该预料到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything that happened here was supposed to happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.07,1:15:45.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫族把我们带到这然后制造武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Bugs brought us here to create a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.78,1:15:48.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么武器? - 夏福特!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What kind of weapon? - Shepherd!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.41,1:15:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会把这个带到联邦去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He could bring this to the top of the Federation!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.25,1:15:53.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须杀了将军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta kill the general,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.35,1:16:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手榴弹!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire in the hole!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.65,1:16:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会死的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.62,1:16:28.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们没那么容易杀死 是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't kill so easy, do they?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.95,1:16:31.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你会死的! - 他们不像我们 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're gonna die! - They're not like us, sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.66,1:16:34.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再也不是了 他们是虫子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore, They're Bugs,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.63,1:16:43.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会死的! 你会死的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna die! You're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.97,1:16:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们关了那反应堆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They shut down the reactors,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.65,1:17:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珊蒂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandee?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.66,1:17:08.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手榴弹!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grenade!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.24,1:17:13.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨哈拉 你还好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sahara, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.00,1:17:22.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怜的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor creatures,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.38,1:17:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为什么必须消灭你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why must we destroy you?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.09,1:17:29.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会告诉你为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you why,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.26,1:17:35.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,造物的潮流向前迈进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Order is the tide of creation...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.64,1:17:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你的种族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but yours is a species...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.69,1:17:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,崇拜个人胜过群体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that worships the one over the many,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.94,1:17:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以拥有智能为荣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You glorify your intelligence...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.15,1:17:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...因为如此你们相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because it allows you to believe anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.95,1:17:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you have a destiny,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.54,1:17:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的权利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you have a right,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.33,1:17:59.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的源由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you have a cause,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.17,1:18:02.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是独特的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you are special,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.51,1:18:05.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是伟大的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you are great,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.80,1:18:07.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是事实上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in truth...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.80,1:18:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们生而疯狂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you are born insane,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.85,1:18:17.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,充满苦痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And such misery...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.19,1:18:20.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以致于不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...cannot be allowed...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.77,1:18:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,散播{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to spread,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.40,1:18:25.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀光他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.91,1:18:34.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨哈拉! 解决将军!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sahara! You get the general!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.88,1:20:52.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 将军夏福特! - 是我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- General Shepherd! - That's me!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.17,1:20:56.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能带他走! 不管怎么做都不能让他上船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't take him! Whatever you do, don't let him onboard!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.14,1:21:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, general!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.66,1:21:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 她需要医疗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen up, She needs medical attention,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.33,1:21:27.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀了将军!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just killed a general officer, mister!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.92,1:21:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那有很多将军 驾驶员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lots of generals out there, flyboy!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.75,1:21:34.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个士兵有很多对联邦重要的情报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This trooper's got information vital to the survival of the Federation!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.76,1:21:37.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她必须不计任何代价安全的到达! 懂了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She must reach safety at all costs! You get me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.05,1:21:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.93,1:21:45.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们走! - 他们太多了 达克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go! - There are too many of them, Dax!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.60,1:21:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你必须要告诉他们你所看到的 告诉他们有新虫种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta tell them what you saw, You gotta tell them about the new Bug!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.73,1:21:51.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你留在这会没命的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stay here, you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.61,1:21:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀人犯是不能回去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murderers don't go home,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.62,1:21:59.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达克斯!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dax!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.45,1:22:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达克斯!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dax!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.55,1:22:57.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达克斯 是一个出色的士兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dax. More than a soldier, not just a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.55,1:22:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一位联邦英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hero of the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.26,1:23:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为我们的战斗他献出了他的生命...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave his life so we could fight...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.43,1:23:08.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都应铭记这句话：{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and these words for us to live by:
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.94,1:23:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"不要为我流泪 我的荣誉长存"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Shed no tears for me. My glory lives forever. "
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.58,1:23:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也将得到这荣誉...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now you too can live the glory...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.17,1:23:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为在机动部队很容易成就一个英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because it's easy to be a hero in the Mobile Infantry.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.25,1:23:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,许多像你这样的男男女女都愿意签名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men and women like you are signing up every day...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.09,1:23:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...为联邦战斗 维护银河{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... to serve the Federation and save the galaxy!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.26,1:23:42.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候成为一份子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it time you did your part?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.43,1:23:43.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可爱的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful baby, ma'am,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.01,1:23:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 士官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sergeant,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.56,1:23:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想想你的朋友和老师会有多注意你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think how impressed friends and teachers will be!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.39,1:23:50.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都热爱公民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone loves a citizen!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.89,1:23:52.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像我这样小士兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little trooper likes me,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.48,1:23:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,签个名 有一天他们也会认为你是英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sign up, and one day they'll call you a hero too!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.32,1:23:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来吧 我们需要新血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up, spud, We need fresh meat for the grinder,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.37,1:24:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要为我流泪 我的荣誉长存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shed no tears for me. My glory lives forever.
